# foxsdr
===
 FoxSDR - free SDR software (software-defined radio receiver) for Windows and Linux, with Android in testing: native RTL-SDR, HackRF, Airspy, SDRplay, RX888 and ADALM-Pluto drivers, spectrum and waterfall, 28 decoder plugins (ADS-B, AIS, APRS, ACARS, POCSAG, SSTV, weather satellites) and a browser remote. Free for noncommercial use.
